"""Pin the STMO suites to the PlatEMO reference.

Every expected value was produced by running PlatEMO (from the checkout at
D:/MatlabPlatform/PlatEMO-master) in MATLAB R2020b on the probe built below,
through each problem's own Evaluation, and is stored so the agreement keeps
being checked without MATLAB installed.

The probe is a fixed lattice of fractions mapped onto each problem's own box,
so the same three points are reproduced on both sides without carrying a
decision matrix per problem. ZDT5 is binary coded, so its fractions are rounded.
"""
